    },
    {
      num: "02",
      title: "Post-Quantum Encryption Momentum",
      desc: "Post-quantum encryption leapt from ~2% to 13% of TLS 1.3 traffic following Chrome 124's default enablement — a paradigm shift in cryptographic standards that organizations must prepare to support."
    },
    {
      num: "03",
      title: "Connectivity Fragility from Government Actions",
      desc: "Government-directed shutdowns were the leading cause of 225 major Internet disruptions (116+ incidents) — highlighting how policy decisions directly impact global connectivity."
    },
