      num: "04",
      title: "Persistent Security Threats",
      desc: "6.5% of all traffic was mitigated, Gambling/Games was the most targeted sector, and Log4j exploitation persists years after disclosure — security vigilance remains non-negotiable."
    },
    {
      num: "05",
      title: "Evolving Developer Ecosystem",
      desc: "Go surpassed other languages to become the top API client language at ~12% of automated API traffic, while HTTP/3 reached 21% adoption — the infrastructure stack is actively modernizing."
    }
  ];

